			"notes": "## AngelLib 1.0.0\n\nFentLib is now AngelLib, part of Angelic Industries.\n\n- **Breaking:** Java packages are now `industries.angelic.angellib`; the mod ID and resource/config namespaces are `angellib`. Update all dependent mods together.\n- Maven coordinates: `industries.angelic.angellib:AngelLib:1.0.0` (`dev` classifier for development).\n- Updated logos, animated Catalogue background, project links, and publishing infrastructure.\n- Both the ordinary and CurseForge variants use the new identity.\n- Updated development dependencies and the GTNH build conventions to 2.0.34. Angelica 2.2.33 includes the glint mixin validation fix needed for startup.\n\nExisting FentLib configurations, integrations, and network payloads are not migrated automatically. Historical FentLib releases remain available."
		},
